 "drawing": "3-door sideboard (= lower part of 0-11 with its own 1349x450 top, no upper). No front view and no dimension lines on the pages (only exploded perspective). Sides 3,4 + partitions 5,6 (681x426) stand on bottom 2 (1349x446, Direkta 7x70); bars 20 (421x70, 2) and 21 (411x70) between them; top 1 (1349x450) on sides/partitions with eccentrics. Inner widths 421/411/421 -> carcass 1317, top/bottom overhang ~16 mm per side; top is 450 deep vs 446 bottom / 426 sides. Plinth box 16/19 (1339x70) + 17/18 (368x70), 6 levelling feet, 8 corner brackets. Facade per section: drawer front (425 wide x 199 high) on top, door 22 (425 wide x 476 high) below. Drawers: sides 400x150 (3+3), backs 353x150 centre / 363x150 sides, ДВП bottoms 405x381 / 405x391; 3 pairs 400 mm guides. Removable shelves behind doors: 7 (415x417, 2) in side sections, 8 (415x407) centre. Pilasters 23 (22x681) on outer side front edges. Backs ДВП 26 441x702 (2) + 27 427x702, scheme p2: 26|27|26. Hinges: side doors inset K-16 2 each (4), centre door half-overlay K-9.5 (2); handles 6 (3 drawers + 3 doors). Height estimate (16 mm boards): 70+16+681+16 = 783."
